## Pinned stack (change only through an ADR in docs/adr/)
`docs/VERSIONS.md` is the source of truth for versions. Read it before installing anything.

- Wazuh 4.14.9 (manager, indexer, dashboard, and agents must all match). Do NOT use Wazuh 5.x
  pre-releases.
- Python 3.12, FastAPI, SQLAlchemy 2, SQLite (dev).
- Node 24 LTS, React 19 + Vite + TypeScript, Tailwind, Recharts, lucide-react.
  - Exact npm/pip versions are locked by lockfiles when each part is created.
- Sigma rules validated with sigma-cli / pySigma.
- GitHub Actions for CI.
